+  "context_echo": {
+    "page": "global-pipeline",
+    "stationName": "甪直分输站"
+  }
+}
+```
+
+### 动作类型建议
+
+- `highlight_station`
+- `highlight_nodes`
+- `highlight_path`
+- `open_history_chart`
+- `open_station_detail`
+- `open_junction_detail`
+- `switch_view`
+- `show_analysis_panel`
+- `apply_topology_filter`
+
